, December 5. No one of them know about it. While planning for it, the Chinese Federation attack Ashford Acaademy and they are forced to stay inside the Clubhouse. Lelouch thought up a plan to defeat them. Lelouch's plan works at first but during the execution of the plan, Suzaku and Kallen's souls are taken in the 'Thousands-man vase' by the Chinese Federation leader. The other student council members hurried to the chapel and they saw the Chinese Federation leader. Nunnally and C.C.'s souls are also taken. Lelouch asked him to call his name, not as Lelouch but as Zero.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-04-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j1qRusRoSEtCUJQcMisPZYPk7T8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j1qRusRoSEtCUJQcMisPZYPk7T8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31724/season/0/episode/32"},{"id":"2276557","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Episodio 33","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-04-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nTaX6LO2UuxfUnopU1JWKGxT4NU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nTaX6LO2UuxfUnopU1JWKGxT4NU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31724/season/0/episode/33"},{"id":"759051","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Episodio 34","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Lelouch makes the ultimate use of his Geass power for his little sister Nunnally, who loves Alice in Wonderland.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-07-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":28,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hOOq9A0NojiYbIfxrNG0tOjAoNs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hOOq9A0NojiYbIfxrNG0tOjAoNs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31724/season/